WEBVTT

00:02:27.518 --> 00:02:30.730
against diseases far much more
deadly to them than COVID-19.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:33.274
Schools that are centers

00:02:33.274 --> 00:02:38.321
of so many child health 
and welfare programs were closed,

00:02:38.321 --> 00:02:40.698
even where teaching occurs outside.

00:02:41.199 --> 00:02:46.913
The wider catalog of the damage
from COVID-19 response is frightening.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:51.042
Over 80 percent of the people
who will die in Africa

00:02:51.042 --> 00:02:54.545
as a result of the indirect
effects of COVID-19

00:02:54.545 --> 00:02:57.840
will be children aged
under five years of age

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.759
by the year 2030.